WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:05.238
[humming]

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:19.552
MELISSANDE: You were
gone a long time.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:27.794
Yes, I stopped
to watch a bird.

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.662
A bird.

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:31.163
A cunning black bird.

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:35.001
It was going after a woodchuck.

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:36.469
And after, where did you go?

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:43.343
If you wish, I will fetch
Rene Sel down from his work

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.444
so you can ask him,
or perhaps Mari could

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:47.781
bring the basket
herself so you can peck

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.215
at her with your questions.

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:51.150
MELISSANDE: I only have
one question that matters.

00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:57.957
Have you found a
solution to Mari?

00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:00.593
No, not yet.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:05.899
And look, we have these baskets
of well-prepared food each day.

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:07.567
Mari does not cross your path.

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:13.339
She is in the cabin, you're
here in the manor house.

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:15.108
It works, Melissande.

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:18.578
[tense music]

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:27.420
I will not banish her.

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:31.223
Your presence is
a challenge to me.

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:34.327
[inaudible] on the land?

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:37.330
I look and see smoke from her
cabin and I know she is here.

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:41.668
And there is no dark
magic to undo the past.

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:44.803
My ancestors tried, they
were burned at the stake.

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:47.506
I don't wish to undo the
past, just fix the present.

00:01:52.312 --> 00:01:57.951
What if you gave her to Rene?

00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:00.586
He has eyes for her.

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:03.389
I've seen it.

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:07.627
This is all I want for
our wedding celebration--

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:09.295
to know that we are
bound and there is

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:12.698
no woman with a claim on you.

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:14.833
So it is a clever fix.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:16.135
Well, it is a fix.

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:17.203
MELISSANDE: Good.

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:19.439
Then talk to him.

